	measure 'Policies Issued (Line Chart)' = ```
			
			VAR SelectedYear = SELECTEDVALUE(dim_date[year_number])
			VAR ChartMonthNum = MAX(TrendMonthAxis[Month Number])
			RETURN
			    IF(
			        ISBLANK(SelectedYear),
			        [Policies Issued],
			        CALCULATE(
			            [Policies Issued],
			            FILTER(
			            ALL(dim_date), 
			            VALUE(dim_date[year_number]) = SelectedYear &&
			            dim_date[month_number] = ChartMonthNum
			        )
			        )
			    )
			```
		formatString: 0
		lineageTag: 5fe5b5de-906a-48aa-96b0-da4915509fa2

